          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Technology: The LCI data in this Eco-profile represent the average applied technology for the production of PTA in Europe. They are based on confidential data collected from PTA production sites. Thus, primary data were used for all foreground processes (under operational control) as well as for the provision of on-site energy, if applicable. These input data are complemented with secondary data from background processes, e.g. grid electricity supply and the raw material pre-chain. PTA imported to Europe is not considered in this Eco-profile.</text>
